## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
This document outlines the strict deployment protocol for migrating Codeward to AWS. A naive migration using AWS default configurations will burn **$218/month in idle infrastructure alone**, exhausting the $1,000 credit in 4.6 months without processing a single Pull Request. By adhering strictly to the FinOps configurations detailed below, the idle burn is reduced to **$74/month**, extending the runway to 13 months and preserving the credit for actual AI inference.

